WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
 Welcome to Connect AI Doom.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:07.000
 I've gotten Doom running on macOS,

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:12.000
 and I've gotten Connect AI integrated via MCP into Doom.

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:16.180
 Right now what you're watching is Claude self directing

00:00:16.180 --> 00:00:18.400
 itself and playing and exploring

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:21.200
 our procedurally generated environment.

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:24.000
 Each room represents a different data source

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:25.920
 and that each of the monsters within the room

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:28.560
 is representing a different entry from the data source.

00:00:28.560 --> 00:00:29.560
 So you can see on screen,

00:00:29.560 --> 00:00:31.520
 this is the Salesforce room,

00:00:31.520 --> 00:00:34.180
 and it's all the entries of our test account

00:00:34.180 --> 00:00:36.160
 with different Salesforce, whatever.

00:00:36.160 --> 00:00:37.440
 But on the right,

00:00:37.440 --> 00:00:39.840
 you can see all of our alive view,

00:00:39.840 --> 00:00:42.400
 what's going on with details from Connect AI

00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:43.940
 about that data source.

00:00:43.940 --> 00:00:46.240
 The different monsters represent the level of urgency

00:00:46.240 --> 00:00:48.200
 or like importance of them.

00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:50.520
 It's easy to configure it's like actually going clear

00:00:50.520 --> 00:00:53.100
 and delete things in here or flag them.

00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:54.600
 But right now it's just read only

00:00:54.600 --> 00:00:56.600
 and kind of viewing and exploring them in Doom.

00:00:56.600 --> 00:01:00.840
 But this was just an experiment to see can I get

00:01:00.840 --> 00:01:05.560
 an MCP server to run in Doom and Connect AI.

00:01:05.560 --> 00:01:09.080
 I also did some light branding on Doom too,

00:01:09.080 --> 00:01:10.860
 with some light Connect AI branding

00:01:10.860 --> 00:01:14.160
 and added our colors in there and stuff like that too.

00:01:14.160 --> 00:01:16.320
 The game is also, you can play it on your own.

00:01:16.320 --> 00:01:18.560
 Like right now Claude is playing it for me,

00:01:18.560 --> 00:01:20.680
 but you can totally do whatever,

00:01:20.680 --> 00:01:22.960
 like this is a fully playable version of Doom

00:01:22.960 --> 00:01:24.100
 with Connect AI.

